Error [E0065]: This function uses the retired `::` body marker.
  --> tests/ui/external_method_field_collision.jet:5:25
    |
  5 | fn Point.x(self) -> Int :: self.x
    |                         ^^
 Why: Named function bodies use braces. `::` binds a name, and `=` fills a slot inside a definition.
 Fix: Replace `::` with `{ … }`; `jet fmt` applies this fix.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0065

Error [E0105]: Method `x` can't share a name with a field on `Point`
  --> tests/ui/external_method_field_collision.jet:5:10
    |
  5 | fn Point.x(self) -> Int :: self.x
    |          ^
 Why: A type's methods and fields must have different names
 Fix: Rename the method or the field
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0105
